abstract: "Decide whether a proactive AI agent may reach a user right now, and log why not: twelve ordered checks, a reason on every rejection, a budget consumed at send time, JSON policies, fourteen presets with sources, adapters for the Vercel AI SDK, Mastra, LangChain and OpenAI Agents, a Python sibling that runs the same fixtures, and a replay CLI."
